@startwbs 09-install-layout

title Single-folder install layout (storage v3)

* <project repo root>
** .cursor/ commands + rules\n(adapter stubs -> sdlc-spdd/)
** .github/ copilot prompts (stub)
** .claude/ commands (stub)
** .gitignore (+ sdlc-spdd/.sdlc/)
** application source (untouched)
** sdlc-spdd/  <<framework home>>
*** ROADMAP.md
*** requirements/
**** milestones/<WORK-ID>.md
*** spdd/
**** canvas/<WORK-ID>.md
**** analysis/<WORK-ID>-analysis.md
**** reviews/<WORK-ID>-review.md
**** sync/<WORK-ID>-sync.md
**** memory/
***** lessons.jsonl  <<committed ledger>>
***** registry.jsonl  <<claim/release events>>
*** harness/ playbooks/ extensions/
*** scripts/  <<installed workflow CLI>>
*** session-notes/ (optional)
*** .sdlc/  <<gitignored runtime>>
**** sessions/current-session.md
**** staged/lessons.jsonl
**** index.sqlite (opt-in cache)

@endwbs
